<style>
  .vnv-working-agreement {background:#f4f7f7;color:#182c30;padding:clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4.25rem) 1.25rem}
  .vnv-working-agreement__inner {max-width:70rem;margin:auto}
  .vnv-working-agreement h2 {margin:0 0 1.25rem;color:#182c30}
  .vnv-working-agreement dl {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem 2.75rem;margin:0}
  .vnv-working-agreement dl>div {border-top:1px solid #b7cdcc;padding-top:.8rem}
  .vnv-working-agreement dt {color:#175452;font-weight:700}
  .vnv-working-agreement dd {margin:.35rem 0 0;color:#2c4043;line-height:1.55}
  @media(max-width:42rem){.vnv-working-agreement dl {grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<section class="vnv-working-agreement" id="how-we-work-together" aria-labelledby="how-we-work-together-title">
  <div class="vnv-working-agreement__inner">
    <h2 id="how-we-work-together-title">How we work together</h2>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>One place for project updates</dt><dd>Send project messages through VNV-Q. We reply within one business day. Our Miami office hours are Monday–Friday, 10 AM–5 PM, and Saturday, 10 AM–2 PM.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Scheduled meetings</dt><dd>We schedule meetings in advance during office hours. Your package or proposal lists how many meetings are included.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>A written scope</dt><dd>Approving your proposal sets the scope. Request changes in VNV-Q. We review them with you and quote approved changes separately for your written approval.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>A dedicated Day Coordinator</dt><dd>Your planner or producer prepares the event. When you book on-site coordination, a different team member takes the handoff and runs the day.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
